{"title":"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/0/a605aefab9962d3deb9f16f214a78f9a98ace325.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{15 - 3^{2}}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"63\" height=\"41\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/e/09e7bf34d97eba5bfaff81c5479bfc076cd2183b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\   2  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(B)}\\   4  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(C)}\\   12  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(D)}\\   48 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(E)}\\   3  \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"402\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/f/a6f998e0379f1b3c74da09cc7fde1c5e6bf616cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{15 - 3^{2}}{3} = \\frac{15 - 9}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"140\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/8/0f8a82a3622377561ff0b480efdb540400dfea7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{6}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"34\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/1/5718d012bee07d415d8b5974ca20a7906ade59f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(A) } 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"77\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/d/d5db1190523eaa7253a714135277c238fc622d12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - 3^{2} = 3(5 - 3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"147\" height=\"21\" />, so the fraction is just <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/0/210097c9f06f2b2847d9af25c3f113309835bd7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 - 3 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(A) } 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"123\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat\">2014 CEMC Fermat</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat P